# Locally-uploaded media. Never commit these - and note they are NOT part of the
# deploy artifact either, so they need their own volume + backup. See ADR 0008.
uploads/

# NOTE: .env.example is ignored here, which is unconventional - normally it is
# tracked and holds placeholders only. It is ignored because the local copy
# currently contains real SMTP credentials. Replace those with placeholders and
# start tracking it again so new clones have a template to copy.
.env.example